<title>NEW ZEALAND: Official segment indicators from NZ wool sale.</title>
<headline>Official segment indicators from NZ wool sale.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The official market indicator from Thursday's wool sales at Christchurch and Napier was 434 NZ cents per kg clean versus 427 at last week's sale, Wools of New Zealand said on Friday.</p>
<p>Official segment indicators, as published by Wools of New Zealand (in cents per kg clean), were:</p>
<p>    Fine     18/24 micron - 851 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Medium   25/31 micron - 561 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Strong   32/41 micron - 374 vs 369</p>
<p>    Lambs		     - 384 vs 380</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
